From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:54:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] downloads: stream long MissAV playlists and recover partial
 local mux failures

Four real downloads stopped at the old one MiB manifest limit. Read local VOD plans incrementally and keep existing cache fingerprints. A completed segment set that produced output before FFmpeg returned EINVAL may use the byte- and duration-verified TS recovery path. Report how much of a fully scanned playlist is retained when fragments remain unavailable. Other engines do not use this segment and mux path.
